      StratonovichHamSecondMomentLeanAuditBridge.IndexedCone.gOfP, StratonovichHamSecondMomentLeanAuditBridge.IndexedCone.cOfP, StratonovichHamSecondMomentLeanAuditBridge.WeakSobolev.rtOfP,
